  anthropic-credits-own-figure
    [not_wired] anthropic-credits-own-figure/provider-not-recorded-on-call
      The observed call record's `provider` key is only set in one place in llm.py; if some call paths (e.g., batched, replayed, embedding, or other record constructors) do not carry `provider`, `summarize` never sees ANTHROPIC and those Anthropic calls are excluded from the Anthropic figure.
