  batch-call-counted-at-billed-price
    [other] batch-call-counted-at-billed-price/provider-read-from-returned-model-name
      The observed call's `provider` is derived from the `model` taken from the recorded response. A batched Anthropic call may record a bare returned model name such as `claude-...` with no `anthropic/` prefix. `provider_of` then gives None, so a batched call's discounted cost never reaches the Anthropic figure.
