    [other] batch-call-counted-at-billed-price/batched-cost-repriced-at-list-price
      The spend table may take each call's cost from a standard per-model price lookup instead of the cost recorded on the call at billing. A batched call would then show the full list price rather than the batch-discounted price. The docstring says nothing here re-prices, but the cost computation is not visible in the diff.
