  provider-routing-by-model-name
    [scope_too_narrow] provider-routing-by-model-name/validator-skips-other-model-fields
      The provider-stating check is applied only to `model`, `embedding_model` and `stage_models`. Any other configured model name on RunConfig (or elsewhere) is not validated, so a bare `claude-...` name can still be routed by LiteLLM's own inference with no stated provider.
