    [missing_case] provider-routing-by-model-name/empty-provider-prefix-accepted
      `provider_of` returns the text before the first `/` whenever a `/` exists. A name like `/claude-x` or ` /model` gives an empty or blank provider rather than None, so it passes validation and is treated as stating a provider.
      src/acceptance/llm.py#0
      src/acceptance/config.py#2
