  provider-decision-single-source
    [other] provider-decision-single-source/provider-rederived-per-consumer
      There is no single resolved provider decision. Cache-breakpoint inclusion, batch eligibility and credit attribution each call `provider_of` on a model string at their own site. Overriding or changing the provider in one place would not change the other two, and each could be handed a different string.
