    [other] provider-decision-single-source/attribution-uses-recorded-model-not-request-model
      Batching and cache markers are decided from the request's model. The `provider` stamped on the observed call comes from a different `model` value, which the comment says is the model the transcript was recorded against. If the two differ, for example on replay against a transcript from another provider, credits are attributed to a different provider than the one that drove breakpoints and batching.
