    [scope_too_narrow] provider-decision-single-source/cache-opening-threshold-still-parses-name
      Only `_needs_explicit_marker` and the batching guard were moved onto `provider_of`. Other provider-dependent helpers, such as `_minimum_reusable_opening(model)`, may still interpret the model name themselves (substring or prefix checks), so they can disagree with the single decision.
