    [scope_too_narrow] provider-decision-single-source/validator-covers-only-some-model-fields
      The provider-stating validator is applied only to `model`, `embedding_model` and `stage_models`. Any other model-name field on `RunConfig` or elsewhere (for example a Jev or reviewer model), or a model name supplied through a path that bypasses config validation, can still reach the client without a stated provider. That name would be treated as having no provider for breakpoints, batching and credits.
